 "timing_rationale": "Coincident: the survey records hours assisted in the week before the interview, published within a quarter.",
 "tracker_interpretation": "Broad but shallow: most workers have touched it, few of their hours run on it. The share using it weekly rose much faster than we expected, so this is the reading to watch.",
 "unit": "share",
