 "updated_at": "2026-09-10",
 "valve_measured": "product_to_adoption",
 "why_it_matters": "Saying you use AI is not the same as working with it. Adoption surveys count anyone who has tried it; this counts the share of working hours actually done with it, which is what any productivity gain has to be built from."
